<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">PHM - NUMANA</book>
  <para style="h">PHM PHM - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHM PHM - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">PHM PHM - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">PHM PHM - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHM PHM - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Icɛr iyiŋɛ ire bǝn nga Bulus, ine ku ne jaru netu ayi Kristi Yesɔ, bǝn Timoti izumɔr.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Ta cɛr Filimɔn ikpa mɔr waŋ ndi ta na ndum ndɔ, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />bǝn amunya abɛ zǝ Arik ndi abiŋ ne kɔmi, bǝn Afiya iva mɔr, tena cɛr Akibo ikpa mɔr ine na ndi nǝ kpaakpa:<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Arik Tetɛɛ mɔr ben Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi abɛ nek zhin iki didik bǝn sik susun.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyɛr bǝn tanyɛme iyi Filimɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Ikpa muŋ Filimɔn, kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ Mben Arik, Mzhɔ sak mi tena nyɛr Arik amuŋ. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Tem wɔ lɛ kɛ tanyɛme min bɔbɔk min aneshir abɛ zǝ Arik ne tanyɛme ben Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Iben muŋ iyi te binetu mɔr ben abezhin abɛ tanyɛme ben Kristi itei Gli izhi ngɔŋ iyi anu adidik iyiŋ ndi ta yime neyi tsin mɔr ne miŋ kǝ biŋ atɔ ben Yesɔ. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Itanyɛme min izhineba amunya, ne nǝm nyɛr ŋgɔŋ tena nǝm klik, izhin ne duŋ asusun abɛ na ndum Arik aŋur aklik.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne ben ne atu ayi Ɔnisimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Ndi iye me mbǝ zhɔk susun, ndi izumin ne miŋ kɛ Kristi, te duŋu ubǝ na ki yiŋ ndi ire te abɛ nai, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />fena ndi Mtanyɛme ben abɔu, waŋa ayi Iben muŋ. Mna amɛ te ai nga Bulus, ayi ayou Kristi Yesɔ, fe azezaŋa Me yi ne jaru ne atu amaa. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Neme Mgli Iben muŋ ngliu ma ne atu ayi Ɔnisimu, iwaŋ ndi ayi vǝvǝne amuŋ ne miŋ kǝ Kristi; ndi Mne yi ne jaru Mne kam yi tetɛɛ amaa ne miŋ kǝ zǝ Arik. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ne ase ayi gayir ane yi kisha bene bɔu, fe azizaŋa neka sen, ayi ner didik bene bɔu ben nga muŋ yime.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />M sharu te abɛ ŋuro akam kɔmɔ bene abɔu azizaŋa, te ayi ne susun muŋ. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Mbǝ duŋɔ asɔŋ bene bɛm, ndi Myi ne jaru ne atu yi du lɛ kǝ Arik, te duŋu abɛ lɔk me ne amkpa ami. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ama, bam ne tanyɛme tem na kinuŋ ne yaŋ zhi mi ba; ne yiŋɛ, Me wɔb te ubɛ na amɛ ne tanyɛme mi. Bam tei na ikinuŋ ne yaŋ tanyɛme mi ba.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Bam ne zhi ki ndi Ɔnisimu ne klu sɔŋ bene bɔu ba ne vǝ mkpaŋ vetsɔb te duŋu abɛ kama nyak. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Fe azizaŋa ba naga ri yi igen ba, te anaŋ gen: ayi zumɔr ne miŋ kɛ zǝ Kristi. Ayi kikin bene abɛm! Te ai nayi kikin bǝn abɔu, ayi ndi gen tena yi ndi ikpa ne miŋ kǝ Ŋgɔŋ!<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Fena, utǝ baŋ me ndi ikpami, ubǝ tau ndi ubǝ tam. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Te yi ndi ne laulɛ nuŋ ka uzǝu ihria nuŋ, ubǝ duŋ kǝ iyi nǝ atu amuŋ. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ayi nga Bulus, Mtei cɛr ne ŋɔk muŋ: Mtei yau. (Bai rɛ tǝm shi zheu ba, ne yiŋɛ, te ihria mi iyi ne atu amuŋ.) <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Fena, izumɔr, mbenu te wɔ zhin muŋ ne sak kǝ Ŋgɔŋ; ndi izumɔr ne min kǝ Kristi, duŋ kpamuŋ bǝ ŋurklik!<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Mni zhi, ndi Mcɛr mple kǝŋe, te utei na iki yiŋ ndi Mdi, ayi lɛ didik Mni zhi te utei nayi inaŋ amɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Ndi ina yi amɛ, Wɔb me amkpa ane kur, tem shur ayi te Arik atei wɔ ben min bɔbɔk te glim aŋyaga bǝn abezhin.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek iyi klɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Abafara, ndi ayi ne jaru bǝn abɛm netu ayi Kristi Yesɔ, ategu maayi, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />ina yi amɛ bǝn akpa abɛ na ndum mɔr Markus, Aristakus, Dimas, bǝn Luka.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Iki didik iyi Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi bǝ yi bǝn abɛ zhin bɔbɔk.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>